      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This large hairy ape-like creature ranges between 8-12 feet tall, weighs in excess of 500 pounds and is covered in snowy white fur.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 20, touch 12, flat-footed 17 (+3 dex, +8 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 132 (10d10+82)</p><p>Fort +12, Ref +9, Will +8</p><p>Immune Ice</p><p>Weakness Fire</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 40 ft., Climb 30 ft.</p><p>Melee 2 Slams +19 (2d6+10)</p><p>Ranged Rock +13 (1d8+15)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Rock Throwing (120 ft.)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 30, Dex 17, Con 24, Int 9, Wis 12, Cha 10</p><p>Base Atk +10; CMB +21; CMD 34</p><p>Feats Cleave, Great Fortitude, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Toughness</p><p>Skills Climb +25, Intimidate +13, Perception +14, Stealth +5 (+13 in snow); Racial Modifiers +4 Stealth (+12 in snow)</p><p>Languages Aklo</p><p>SQ Blood Rage, Raise Dukes</p>"
